  <h2>Notice and repair errors</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="brazilian" data-hint="After from, check whether the final word is a country or a nationality adjective." data-fix="I am from Brazil." data-why="After from we name the country, not the nationality adjective. So it is from Brazil, not from Brazilian.">
    <h3>Drill 5: from a country or a nationality?</h3>
    <p>Tap the word that is wrong.</p>
    <div class="spot-options">
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="i">I</button>
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="am">am</button>
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="from">from</button>
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="brazilian">Brazilian.</button>
