  </div>

  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="japanese" data-hint="Nationality adjectives begin with a capital letter in English." data-fix="She is Japanese." data-why="Nationality adjectives always start with a capital letter, so we write Japanese, not japanese.">
