  <h2>Read and choose</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>A fictional team profile</h3>
    <p><span class="ex">“Paulo uses he. He states that he is from Brazil and speaks Portuguese. Yuki uses she. She states that she is Japanese and is from Osaka, Japan. Sara uses she. She states that she is Egyptian and speaks Arabic and English.”</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You found Paulo's stated country, Yuki's stated nationality, and Sara's stated languages without inferring one fact from another.">
    <h3>Read, then choose</h3>
    <div class="quiz-list">
